{"id":"n77066-2-10","stage":4,"title":"주전 · 主力","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77066-2-10-1","ko":"오늘 경기부터 주전으로 뽑혀서 뛰게 되었는데 기분이 어떠세요?","zh":"从今天的比赛开始，您被选为主力上场，感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"경기부터","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기부터","audio":"/audio/7f2972e4f2bfb3f1dd01.mp3"}},{"text":"주전으로","meaning":"主力","explanation":"주전：主力；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"주전","audio":"/audio/466151385d412fada8d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77066","senseId":"2","lemma":"주전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주전으로","audio":"/audio/f67fbbaf77ebfcad2730.mp3"}},{"text":"뽑혀서","meaning":"被选出","explanation":"뽑히다：被选出；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"뽑히다","audio":"/audio/e38b8bcd2bc666678047.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15652","senseId":"3","lemma":"뽑히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뽑혀서","audio":"/audio/d44b86a3a9877f2315d3.mp3"}},{"text":"뛰게","meaning":"当，活动，奔波","explanation":"뛰다：当，活动，奔波；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"뛰다","audio":"/audio/96e5ecf6b0d33341a17f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74124","senseId":"2","lemma":"뛰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛰게","audio":"/audio/4b328c41e9ea2e015c13.mp3"}},{"text":"되었는데","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"ter